Architecture plan: {{ plan_title }}
{{ plan_summary }}

Guiding mission: {{ mission.GuidingIntent }}
Success outcomes:
{{ for outcome in mission.SuccessOutcomes }}
- {{ outcome }}
{{ end }}
Non-goals:
{{ for non_goal in mission.NonGoals }}
- {{ non_goal }}
{{ end }}

Immutable parent task:
- ID: {{ parent_task.Id }}
- Title: {{ parent_task.Title }}
- Objective: {{ parent_task.Objective }}
- Complexity: {{ parent_task.ComplexityPoints }}
- Estimated files: {{ parent_task.EstimatedFiles }}

Parent deliverables:
{{ for item in parent_task.Deliverables }}
- {{ item }}
{{ end }}

Project:
- Name: {{ project.Name }}
- Path: {{ project.Path }}
- Kind: {{ project.Kind }}
- Architectural role: {{ project.Role }}
- Target framework: {{ project.TargetFramework }}

Referenced projects:
{{ if project_dependencies.size > 0 }}
{{ for dependency in project_dependencies }}
- {{ dependency.Name }} | {{ dependency.Role }} | {{ dependency.Path }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
- None.
{{ end }}

Module:
- ID: {{ module.Id }}
- Name: {{ module.Name }}
{{ for item in module.Responsibilities }}
- {{ item }}
{{ end }}

Immutable contracts:
{{ if contracts.size > 0 }}
{{ for contract in contracts }}
- {{ contract.Id }} | {{ contract.Kind }} {{ contract.Name }}: {{ contract.Purpose }}
{{ for member in contract.Members }}
  - {{ member }}
{{ end }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
- None assigned.
{{ end }}

Typed contract relationships:
- Defines:
{{ if parent_task.Relationships.DefinesContractIds.size > 0 }}
{{ for id in parent_task.Relationships.DefinesContractIds }}
  - {{ id }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
  - None
{{ end }}
- Implements ports:
{{ if parent_task.Relationships.ImplementsPortContractIds.size > 0 }}
{{ for id in parent_task.Relationships.ImplementsPortContractIds }}
  - {{ id }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
  - None
{{ end }}
- Consumes:
{{ if parent_task.Relationships.ConsumesContractIds.size > 0 }}
{{ for id in parent_task.Relationships.ConsumesContractIds }}
  - {{ id }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
  - None
{{ end }}

Typed component dependencies:
{{ if component_dependencies.size > 0 }}
{{ for dependency in component_dependencies }}
- {{ dependency.TaskId }} | {{ dependency.Kind }} | {{ dependency.ProjectRole }} project {{ dependency.ProjectName }} | {{ dependency.Title }}
{{ for deliverable in dependency.Deliverables }}
  - Deliverable: {{ deliverable }}
{{ end }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
- No component dependencies are required.
{{ end }}

Acceptance criteria:
{{ if acceptance_criteria.size > 0 }}
{{ for criterion in acceptance_criteria }}
- {{ criterion.Id }} | {{ criterion.Feature }} | {{ criterion.Scenario }}
{{ for step in criterion.Given }}
  Given {{ step }}
{{ end }}
{{ for step in criterion.When }}
  When {{ step }}
{{ end }}
{{ for step in criterion.Then }}
  Then {{ step }}
{{ end }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
- None assigned.
{{ end }}

Owning use cases:
{{ if use_cases.size > 0 }}
{{ for use_case in use_cases }}
- {{ use_case.Id }} | {{ use_case.BoundedContext }} | {{ use_case.Name }}: {{ use_case.Objective }}
{{ for rule in use_case.BusinessRules }}
  - Rule: {{ rule }}
{{ end }}
{{ for outcome in use_case.ErrorOutcomes }}
  - Error outcome: {{ outcome }}
{{ end }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
- None assigned.
{{ end }}

Architecture decisions:
{{ if decisions.size > 0 }}
{{ for decision in decisions }}
- {{ decision.Id }} | {{ decision.Title }}: {{ decision.Decision }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
- None.
{{ end }}

Architecture notes:
{{ if architecture_notes.size > 0 }}
These are reviewed defaults and inferred constraints. Apply each decision to the leaves that implement its affected IDs and include the constraint in their concrete requirements.
{{ for note in architecture_notes }}
- {{ note.Id }} | {{ note.Category }} | {{ note.Subject }}: {{ note.Decision }}
  - Impact: {{ note.Impact }}
  - Affected IDs: {{ for affected_id in note.AffectedIds }}{{ affected_id }}{{ if !for.last }}, {{ end }}{{ end }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
- None.
{{ end }}

Resolved upstream artifacts:
{{ if resolved_dependencies.size > 0 }}
These artifacts were resolved by validated decompositions of dependency tasks. Their paths, namespaces, and type names are immutable; reference them exactly and do not recreate or rename them.
{{ for artifact in resolved_dependencies }}
- Task {{ artifact.ArchitectureTaskId }} / leaf {{ artifact.LeafTaskId }}
  - Path: {{ artifact.Path }}
  - Kind: {{ artifact.Kind }}
  - Namespace: {{ artifact.Namespace }}
{{ for type_name in artifact.FullyQualifiedTypeNames }}
  - Type: {{ type_name }}
{{ end }}
{{ for requirement in artifact.EffectiveRequirements }}
  - Resolved requirement: {{ requirement }}
{{ end }}
{{ if artifact.RelatedContractIds.size > 0 }}
  - Related contracts: {{ for contract_id in artifact.RelatedContractIds }}{{ contract_id }}{{ if !for.last }}, {{ end }}{{ end }}
{{ end }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
- No upstream code-generation artifacts are required.
{{ end }}

Resolved upstream contracts:
{{ if resolved_dependency_contracts.size > 0 }}
These are the complete architecture contracts referenced by upstream artifacts. Their member signatures and semantics are immutable.
{{ for contract in resolved_dependency_contracts }}
- {{ contract.Id }} | {{ contract.Kind }} {{ contract.Name }}: {{ contract.Purpose }}
{{ for member in contract.Members }}
  - {{ member }}
{{ end }}
{{ end }}
{{ else }}
- None.
{{ end }}

Return execution-ready leaves or explicit architecture gaps through {{ result_tool_name }}.
{{ if session_context }}
Session memory and code-graph context:
{{ session_context }}
{{ end }}
